[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558400304","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100727#issuecomment-2558400304","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100727","id":2558400304,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Yfhcw","user":{"login":"Giganzo","id":158825920,"node_id":"U_kgDOCXd9wA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158825920?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo","html_url":"https://github.com/Giganzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-22T10:01:41Z","updated_at":"2024-12-22T10:01:41Z","body":"Doesn't happen on v4.4.dev5.official [9e6098432]","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558400304/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558449280","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100727#issuecomment-2558449280","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100727","id":2558449280,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YftaA","user":{"login":"mdelorme","id":2743366,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDMzNjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2743366?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdelorme","html_url":"https://github.com/mdelorme","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdelorme/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdelorme/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdelorme/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdelorme/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdelorme/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdelorme/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdelorme/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdelorme/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdelorme/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-22T13:02:15Z","updated_at":"2024-12-22T13:13:43Z","body":"Bisecting seems to show the culprit is commit ff6eea5\n\nWhat I think is happening is : \n1. The project manager window is given a title at creation by directly going through the `DisplayServer` without using the `Window` node [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/editor/project_manager.cpp#L1142))\n2. The scene tree is initialized with everything.\n3. Post \"enter tree\", commit ff6eea5 sends a `NOTIFICATION_TRANSLATION_CHANGED` to the nodes\n4. The `Window` node receives the notification, and re-translates the title [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/scene/main/window.cpp#L1436). However, to do so it uses the `title` variable that has never been set. The title is thus empty, but since we're on a dev version (with `DEBUG_ENABLED` active), `(Debug)` is appened at the end of the empty string. Giving thus the wrong title.\n\nI'm really not sure how to proceed to fix this, because by the time the title is first set, the `Window` node does not exist and so we cannot set the `title` variable properly. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558449280/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558506525","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100727#issuecomment-2558506525","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100727","id":2558506525,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Yf7Yd","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-22T16:14:36Z","updated_at":"2024-12-22T16:14:42Z","body":"> Bisecting seems to show the culprit is commit [ff6eea5](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/ff6eea50423867f63764e3b85d3ad79c21119085)\n\nCC @AThousandShips ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558506525/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558507261","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100727#issuecomment-2558507261","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100727","id":2558507261,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Yf7j9","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-22T16:17:21Z","updated_at":"2024-12-22T16:20:43Z","body":"Then the older more extensive solution I had might have been required, this particular change can't really safely be reverted as it solves a pretty serious crash\n\nCan't really work on a fix for that part right now, but it shouldn't be relying on that detail I think, so something else is likely wrong\n\nCC @YeldhamDev ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558507261/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0